UI rebuild complete. Here's a summary of all changes:

**Design Tokens (globals.css)**
- Updated to spec: `#0A0A0A` background, `rgba(255,255,255,0.04)` card bg, `#F5F0EB` text, `#D4AF61` accent
- New radius scale: 16px cards, 12px buttons, 24px modals
- Added `--bg-card`, `--bg-frosted`, `--radius-full`, `--tab-bar-height`
- Added `pulse-glow`, `reveal-slide`, `glass-card` utilities

**Main Page (page.tsx) — Complete Rebuild**
- Bottom tab bar with 4 tabs: Closet, Outfits, Try-On, Settings (with SVG icons + animated indicator pill)
- **Closet tab**: Product URL input + pill-shaped category filter chips + product grid with cards showing store badge, favorite heart, photo count, "Try On" / "View Fit" buttons
- **Outfits tab**: Header with "+ New Outfit" button + outfit card grid
- **Try-On tab**: Dedicated flow — select product from grid → side-by-side before/after with reference photo → Generate button → spring-animated reveal
- **Settings tab**: Reference photo upload + PIN change (inline, no page navigation needed)
- All `data-testid` attributes added: `product-card`, `category-tab`, `add-button`, `lightbox`, `tryon-button`

**Components Updated**
- `MotionLightbox`: New glass-style borders, updated tokens, `data-testid="lightbox"`
- `ProductCard`: Glass card styling, motion animations on buttons, `data-testid` attrs
- `EmptyState`: Updated to new design tokens
- `ProductInput`: Updated styling with `data-testid="add-button"`

**Outfit & Settings Pages**: Updated to match new design system (frosted glass nav, card backgrounds, consistent spacing)

**All API routes, data files, scraper, db, and generate modules untouched.**
